WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.010
Next, add your other machines.

2
00:00:03.010 --> 00:00:06.427
Every machine you own is more free compute for you.

3
00:00:07.427 --> 00:00:12.142
This line shows how many machines are on your account, and how many are online.

4
00:00:13.142 --> 00:00:16.841
On a Mac or a Windows PC, install the desktop app.

5
00:00:16.841 --> 00:00:19.060
Sign in with the same account.

6
00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:24.878
For Linux and GPU servers, get an install token from Settings, Nodes.

7
00:00:24.878 --> 00:00:28.090
Then run this installer command on the server.

8
00:00:29.090 --> 00:00:33.890
Each GPU gets its own agent, with a model sized to its memory.

9
00:00:34.890 --> 00:00:38.769
On a Mac, allow Local Network access when macOS asks.

10
00:00:38.769 --> 00:00:43.965
EdgeCoder uses it to find your other machines, and reach them directly.

11
00:00:44.965 --> 00:00:47.568
When a second machine connects, this checks off.

12
00:00:48.568 --> 00:00:50.658
Only have this one computer?

13
00:00:50.658 --> 00:00:52.374
You can skip this step.
